1
00:00:01,007 --> 00:00:03,057
♪

2
00:00:03,057 --> 00:00:04,637
( Kirito yells )

3
00:00:12,017 --> 00:00:13,817
GOD DAMN IT.

4
00:00:13,817 --> 00:00:17,687
HOW COULD YOU LET YOURSELF
GIVE IN TO THE SYNTHESIS RITUAL?

5
00:00:17,687 --> 00:00:20,067
YOU FORGET
WHY YOU’RE A SWORDSMAN,

6
00:00:20,067 --> 00:00:23,777
WHY YOU LEFT RULID AND CAME
TO CENTORIA IN THE FIRST PLACE?

7
00:00:23,777 --> 00:00:25,577
YOU’RE HERE FOR ALICE.

8
00:00:25,577 --> 00:00:27,697
YOU’RE HERE TO TAKE HER
BACK HOME WITH YOU!

9
00:00:42,177 --> 00:00:44,847
( both yell )

10
00:00:52,057 --> 00:00:53,727
( singing in Japanese )

11
00:00:53,727 --> 00:00:56,477
♪

12
00:01:24,717 --> 00:01:27,257
♪ PROUD OF MYSELF ♪

13
00:01:34,517 --> 00:01:36,687
♪

14
00:02:28,647 --> 00:02:33,317
Kirito: EUGEO, YOU AND ME NEVER
HAD A FULL-ON FIGHT BEFORE.

15
00:02:34,487 --> 00:02:35,577
( grunts )

16
00:02:35,577 --> 00:02:37,907
I USED TO THINK ABOUT WHO’D WIN,

17
00:02:37,907 --> 00:02:40,957
THE DAY EVER CAME
WE GOT TO CROSS SWORDS FOR REAL.

18
00:02:40,957 --> 00:02:43,417
TO TELL THE TRUTH,

19
00:02:43,417 --> 00:02:46,707
I KNEW YOU’D BEAT ME ONE DAY,
BUT THAT AIN’T TODAY.

20
00:02:46,707 --> 00:02:49,007
( chuckles )

21
00:02:49,007 --> 00:02:52,337
I’LL SHOW HIM A MOVE
HE’S NEVER SEEN ME DO BEFORE!

22
00:03:01,187 --> 00:03:02,267
( gasps )

23
00:03:05,897 --> 00:03:07,267
Eugeo: BURST ELEMENT.

24
00:03:07,267 --> 00:03:08,857
♪

25
00:03:10,317 --> 00:03:11,487
( Kirito yelps )

26
00:03:11,487 --> 00:03:13,067
( Alice gasps )

27
00:03:18,577 --> 00:03:20,287
HE IS MUCH TOO POWERFUL.

28
00:03:20,287 --> 00:03:22,957
I DOUBT THIS ONE
IS REALLY YOUR FRIEND.

29
00:03:22,957 --> 00:03:24,787
Kirito: WHAT ARE
YOU TALKING ABOUT?

30
00:03:24,787 --> 00:03:26,087
IF HE’S BEEN SYNTHESIZED,

31
00:03:26,087 --> 00:03:27,917
WOULDN’T THAT
MAKE HIM SUPER STRONG?

32
00:03:27,917 --> 00:03:30,337
Alice: THAT IS TRUE. HOWEVER...

33
00:03:30,337 --> 00:03:32,047
SOMETHING IS OFF ABOUT HIM.

34
00:03:32,047 --> 00:03:35,507
FOR ONE WHO ONLY JUST BECAME
AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT,

35
00:03:35,507 --> 00:03:38,387
HE SEEMS
TOO ACCUSTOMED TO BATTLE.

36
00:03:38,387 --> 00:03:41,887
INCARNATE ARMS AND THAT AERIAL
ELEMENT SKILL HE JUST USED

37
00:03:41,887 --> 00:03:45,187
ARE FAR TOO ADVANCED
FOR A NEWCOMER TO HAVE MASTERED.

38
00:03:47,817 --> 00:03:50,277
YOU SHOULD LET ME HANDLE HIM.

39
00:03:50,277 --> 00:03:53,147
Kirito: MM-MMM. I GOT THIS.

40
00:04:01,997 --> 00:04:03,457
ALL RIGHT, BUDDY.

41
00:04:03,457 --> 00:04:06,417
WHEN THIS IS OVER,
I’LL GIVE YOU A NAME.

42
00:04:06,417 --> 00:04:08,247
JUST HELP ME GET THROUGH THIS.

43
00:04:08,247 --> 00:04:10,167
( breathes deeply )

44
00:04:10,167 --> 00:04:11,877
EN GARDE, EUGEO!

45
00:04:11,877 --> 00:04:14,047
♪

46
00:04:27,187 --> 00:04:29,437
( groans )

47
00:04:43,157 --> 00:04:44,077
( gasps )

48
00:04:52,047 --> 00:04:55,087
SNAPPY MOVE. IT GOT A NAME?

49
00:04:55,087 --> 00:04:57,717
Eugeo: BALTO STYLE, STORM WAVE.

50
00:04:57,717 --> 00:05:01,097
Kirito: WAIT. BALTO?
AS IN GOLGOROSSO BALTO?

51
00:05:01,097 --> 00:05:03,597
EUGEO, THINK BACK.

52
00:05:03,597 --> 00:05:07,227
DO YOU REMEMBER THE GUY
THAT TAUGHT YOU HOW TO DO THAT?

53
00:05:07,227 --> 00:05:09,097
Eugeo: I DON’T,
AND I DON’T CARE.

54
00:05:09,097 --> 00:05:12,437
THE ONLY PERSON
I NEED TO REMEMBER IS HER.

55
00:05:12,437 --> 00:05:15,027
SHE IS THE REASON
I USE MY SWORD.

56
00:05:15,027 --> 00:05:17,737
I EXIST
TO ELIMINATE HER ENEMIES.

57
00:05:17,737 --> 00:05:19,567
( Kirito growls )

58
00:05:19,567 --> 00:05:24,037
HE’S GOT A CRYSTAL IN HIS HEAD,
JUST LIKE ELDRIE AND ALICE.

59
00:05:24,037 --> 00:05:26,457
Cardinal: ONCE THE PIETY MODULE
IS INSERTED,

60
00:05:26,457 --> 00:05:29,787
IT EFFECTIVELY BLOCKS
THE LINKS TO MEMORIES.

61
00:05:29,787 --> 00:05:33,337
WITH THAT, THE PROSPECTIVE
KNIGHT’S PAST IS SEALED AWAY,

62
00:05:33,337 --> 00:05:36,507
THE RESULT, A KNIGHT
WHO IS LOYAL TO THE CHURCH

63
00:05:36,507 --> 00:05:38,627
AND TO THEIR CREATOR,
THE PONTIFEX.

64
00:05:38,627 --> 00:05:41,637
Kirito: WHAT MEMORIES
ARE BEING BLOCKED?

65
00:05:41,637 --> 00:05:43,847
IF I CAN FIGURE IT OUT
AND REMIND HIM,

66
00:05:43,847 --> 00:05:45,557
HE’LL SNAP OUT OF IT.

67
00:05:45,557 --> 00:05:48,187
NO. IT’LL TAKE MORE THAN WORDS

68
00:05:48,187 --> 00:05:51,517
TO BREAK ADMINISTRATOR’S SPELL.

69
00:05:51,517 --> 00:05:53,817
I’LL POUR MY HEART
INTO MY SWORD.

70
00:05:53,817 --> 00:05:55,027
THAT’LL REACH HIM!

71
00:05:55,027 --> 00:05:57,027
HELL, IT BETTER!

72
00:05:58,277 --> 00:06:01,867
EUGEO!

73
00:06:01,867 --> 00:06:03,447
♪

74
00:06:05,327 --> 00:06:08,747
I’M GONNA FORCE YOU TO REMEMBER
EVERYONE YOU CARED ABOUT!

75
00:06:08,747 --> 00:06:11,247
BACK IN RULID,
THERE’S A GIRL WAITING FOR YOU!

76
00:06:11,247 --> 00:06:12,707
HER NAME’S SELKA!

77
00:06:12,707 --> 00:06:14,587
AT THE SWORDCRAFT ACADEMY,

78
00:06:14,587 --> 00:06:16,667
GOLGOROSSO WAS YOUR MENTOR,
AND LIENA WAS MINE!

79
00:06:16,667 --> 00:06:20,377
AND TIESE AND RONIE!
’MEMBER WHEN WE LAST SAW ’EM?!

80
00:06:20,377 --> 00:06:21,587
COME ON, MAN!

81
00:06:21,587 --> 00:06:24,297
YOU GOTTA REMEMBER
WHY YOU CAME HERE!

82
00:06:24,297 --> 00:06:26,267
IT’S TO TAKE ALICE BACK HOME!

83
00:06:30,557 --> 00:06:32,767
( Eugeo gasping )

84
00:06:32,767 --> 00:06:34,267
Kirito: REMEMBER, DAMN IT!

85
00:06:35,567 --> 00:06:38,067
( yells )

86
00:06:38,067 --> 00:06:40,527
( Eugeo yells )

87
00:06:40,527 --> 00:06:42,697
♪

88
00:07:02,547 --> 00:07:04,717
( young Kirito chuckles )

89
00:07:10,727 --> 00:07:11,807
Kirito: EUGEO.

90
00:07:14,397 --> 00:07:15,767
HUH?

91
00:07:26,527 --> 00:07:27,777
Eugeo: ALICE.

92
00:07:27,777 --> 00:07:29,077
( Kirito gasps )

93
00:07:29,077 --> 00:07:30,827
D-DO YOU REMEMBER HER?

94
00:07:32,747 --> 00:07:34,327
( gasps )

95
00:07:34,327 --> 00:07:37,287
E-EUGEO.

96
00:07:39,877 --> 00:07:41,127
- ( gasps )
- WATCH OUT!

97
00:07:44,507 --> 00:07:46,047
Eugeo: ENHANCE ARMAMENT.

98
00:07:49,887 --> 00:07:50,967
( Alice gasps )

99
00:07:52,097 --> 00:07:54,387
( Kirito gasping )

100
00:07:58,227 --> 00:07:59,937
EUGEO...

101
00:07:59,937 --> 00:08:01,277
WHY?

102
00:08:02,737 --> 00:08:05,067
( footsteps thudding )

103
00:08:14,577 --> 00:08:17,377
( ice cracks )

104
00:08:27,257 --> 00:08:29,637
( Chudelkin laughing )

105
00:08:29,637 --> 00:08:32,717
♪

106
00:08:32,717 --> 00:08:34,427
I TRUST YOU TOOK CARE

107
00:08:34,427 --> 00:08:38,687
OF THOSE DESPICABLE TRAITORS,
NUMBER THIRTY-TWO.

108
00:08:38,687 --> 00:08:42,027
Eugeo: I HAVE THEM BOTH TRAPPED
IN ICE, PRIME SENATOR, SIR.

109
00:08:42,027 --> 00:08:43,277
THEY CAN’T GO ANYWHERE.

110
00:08:43,277 --> 00:08:45,197
Chudelkin: YOU DON’T SAY!

111
00:08:45,197 --> 00:08:47,277
THAT’S ALL WELL AND GOOD,
MY BOY.

112
00:08:47,277 --> 00:08:51,117
BUT YOU DID NOT
FINISH THEM OFF, DID YOU?

113
00:08:51,117 --> 00:08:54,537
Eugeo: NO, PRIME SENATOR.
I DID NOT.

114
00:08:54,537 --> 00:08:56,247
MY ORDERS FROM THE PONTIFEX

115
00:08:56,247 --> 00:08:58,667
WERE TO STOP THE TRAITORS,
NOT TO KILL THEM.

116
00:08:58,667 --> 00:09:01,747
Chudelkin: THAT WON’T DO.
THAT SIMPLY WON’T DO!

117
00:09:01,747 --> 00:09:05,087
AND WHEN YOU SPEAK TO ME,
YOU CALL ME "YOUR EXCELLENCY."

118
00:09:05,087 --> 00:09:07,967
DO NOT FORGET THAT AGAIN,
NUMBER THIRTY-TWO,

119
00:09:07,967 --> 00:09:10,297
BECAUSE IF YOU DO,
I WILL PUNISH YOU

120
00:09:10,297 --> 00:09:12,177
BY TURNING YOU INTO A HORSE.

121
00:09:12,177 --> 00:09:14,467
AND THEN
I SHALL RIDE ON YOUR BACK,

122
00:09:14,467 --> 00:09:16,477
SHOUTING "GIDDY-UP,
LITTLE HORSIE!

123
00:09:16,477 --> 00:09:18,727
GIDDY-UP!" ( laughs )

124
00:09:18,727 --> 00:09:21,107
I’LL FINISH THEM OFF

125
00:09:21,107 --> 00:09:23,687
AND SHOW HER EMINENCE
WHO’S MORE LOYAL.

126
00:09:24,817 --> 00:09:26,737
( laughing )

127
00:09:28,107 --> 00:09:29,357
HAH!

128
00:09:36,787 --> 00:09:39,247
Eugeo: I HAVE RETURNED, MY LADY.

129
00:09:39,247 --> 00:09:41,627
Administrator:
WELCOME BACK, EUGEO.

130
00:09:41,627 --> 00:09:45,007
DID YOU COMPLETE
THE TASK I GAVE YOU?

131
00:09:45,007 --> 00:09:47,047
- Eugeo: YES.
- Administrator: WELL DONE!

132
00:09:47,047 --> 00:09:49,837
YOU DESERVE A REWARD. COME.

133
00:09:49,837 --> 00:09:51,637
CLIMB INTO BED WITH ME.

134
00:09:59,557 --> 00:10:04,607
ALL RIGHT. AS PROMISED, I SHALL
GIVE YOU YOUR HEART’S DESIRE...

135
00:10:05,977 --> 00:10:08,317
LOVE FOR YOU AND YOU ALONE.

136
00:10:09,907 --> 00:10:11,567
Eugeo: YES.

137
00:10:11,567 --> 00:10:15,327
Administrator: FIRST, I SHOULD
DO SOMETHING ABOUT THAT WOUND.

138
00:10:19,707 --> 00:10:21,537
NOW, THEN...

139
00:10:21,537 --> 00:10:24,037
LET ME HAVE A LOOK
AT YOUR FACE AGAIN.

140
00:10:25,417 --> 00:10:27,707
I FOUND AN ODD GAP
IN YOUR MEMORY,

141
00:10:27,707 --> 00:10:30,087
AND THAT IS
WHERE I PUT THE MODULE.

142
00:10:30,087 --> 00:10:33,637
CONVENIENT, BUT I SHOULD
NOT HAVE RUSHED THE PROCESS.

143
00:10:33,637 --> 00:10:36,467
I’LL RESYNTHESIZE YOU
PROPERLY.

144
00:10:36,467 --> 00:10:39,017
AND THEN, AFTER THAT,
YOU SHALL HAVE YOUR REWARD.

145
00:10:43,437 --> 00:10:45,317
( Eugeo gasps )

146
00:10:46,437 --> 00:10:49,027
♪

147
00:11:00,037 --> 00:11:02,287
( music playing only )

148
00:11:07,997 --> 00:11:10,967
( gasping )

149
00:11:10,967 --> 00:11:13,297
Administrator:
BE A GOOD BOY, AND STAY STILL.

150
00:11:18,717 --> 00:11:22,557
THIS MODULE IS A VAST
IMPROVEMENT OVER THE OLD ONES.

151
00:11:22,557 --> 00:11:24,187
IT BOLSTERS THE IMAGINATION

152
00:11:24,187 --> 00:11:28,397
AND UNLOCKS ADVANCED ARTS
LIKE INCARNATE ARMS.

153
00:11:31,857 --> 00:11:34,817
NOW RELAX, AND SHOW ME
YOUR MEMORIES AGAIN,

154
00:11:34,817 --> 00:11:36,827
AND, THIS TIME, I’LL INSERT IT

155
00:11:36,827 --> 00:11:38,907
INTO THE MEMORY
YOU HOLD MOST DEAR.

156
00:11:40,197 --> 00:11:42,907
YOU CAN’T MOVE,
BUT YOU MAY SPEAK.

157
00:11:42,907 --> 00:11:46,957
NOW CHANT THE SPELL
I TAUGHT YOU. GO ON.

158
00:11:46,957 --> 00:11:49,497
DON’T TELL ME
YOU’VE FORGOTTEN IT ALREADY.

159
00:11:49,497 --> 00:11:50,917
OH, YOU SILLY THING.

160
00:11:50,917 --> 00:11:54,377
"REMOVE CORE PROTECTION."

161
00:11:54,377 --> 00:11:55,387
( Eugeo gasping )

162
00:11:55,387 --> 00:11:57,217
( Administrator chuckles )

163
00:12:00,057 --> 00:12:01,057
( sighs )

164
00:12:01,057 --> 00:12:02,517
( gasps )

165
00:12:02,517 --> 00:12:04,557
( Eugeo grunting ) MO-MO...

166
00:12:04,557 --> 00:12:07,437
MO...( stammering )

167
00:12:07,437 --> 00:12:08,937
MOVE!

168
00:12:08,937 --> 00:12:09,977
Administrator: HOW DARE YOU?!

169
00:12:11,817 --> 00:12:14,607
( Eugeo screams )

170
00:12:19,237 --> 00:12:21,697
( grunting )

171
00:12:21,697 --> 00:12:24,617
( screams )

172
00:12:29,457 --> 00:12:31,337
( grunting )

173
00:12:44,847 --> 00:12:47,017
Administrator: I SEE
YOU REGAINED YOUR SENSES.

174
00:12:47,017 --> 00:12:48,607
I CAN’T BELIEVE YOU FOOLED ME.

175
00:12:51,937 --> 00:12:54,107
I ASSUME THE LITTLE BRAT
FROM THE LIBRARY

176
00:12:54,107 --> 00:12:55,947
GAVE YOU THAT KNIFE, YES?

177
00:12:55,947 --> 00:12:58,777
( chuckles )
STAB ME ALL YOU WANT.

178
00:12:58,777 --> 00:13:00,407
I AM IMPERVIOUS TO IT.

179
00:13:00,407 --> 00:13:03,497
NO METAL OBJECT
CAN PIERCE MY SKIN.

180
00:13:03,497 --> 00:13:05,867
- ( Eugeo gasps )
- YOU POOR CHILD,

181
00:13:05,867 --> 00:13:08,247
TO REJECT THE PROMISE I MADE.

182
00:13:08,247 --> 00:13:10,877
ALL YOU HAD TO DO
WAS GIVE YOURSELF TO ME,

183
00:13:10,877 --> 00:13:12,917
AND I WOULD
LOVE YOU BACK IN RETURN,

184
00:13:12,917 --> 00:13:16,877
THE KIND OF LOVE YOU SOUGHT
ALL YOUR LIFE, ETERNAL LOVE,

185
00:13:16,877 --> 00:13:21,047
ETERNAL CONTROL, AND YOU
CHOSE TO REJECT IT LIKE THIS.

186
00:13:22,637 --> 00:13:25,637
Eugeo: ETERNAL LOVE?

187
00:13:25,637 --> 00:13:29,097
ETERNAL CONTROL.

188
00:13:29,097 --> 00:13:30,937
Administrator:
THAT’S RIGHT, EUGEO.

189
00:13:30,937 --> 00:13:33,437
IF YOU GIVE YOURSELF TO ME,
THAT THIRST

190
00:13:33,437 --> 00:13:36,527
YOU’VE BEEN SUFFERING FROM
WOULD BE INSTANTLY QUENCHED,

191
00:13:36,527 --> 00:13:38,527
AND ALL THE CONFUSION AND FEAR

192
00:13:38,527 --> 00:13:41,407
YOU HARBORED FOR SO LONG
WOULD DISAPPEAR.

193
00:13:41,407 --> 00:13:44,947
BUT I SHALL GIVE YOU
ONE MORE CHANCE.

194
00:13:44,947 --> 00:13:47,657
TAKE YOUR SWORD,
AND SMASH THAT TOY.

195
00:13:47,657 --> 00:13:50,577
DO THAT, AND I SHALL
FORGIVE YOUR SINS

196
00:13:50,577 --> 00:13:53,547
AND SHOWER YOU WITH
THE BOUNTY OF MY LOVE.

197
00:13:55,087 --> 00:13:59,757
Eugeo: TO LOVE IS TO CONTROL
AND TO BE CONTROLLED.

198
00:14:01,637 --> 00:14:04,967
IF THAT IS HOW YOU THINK OF IT,
THEN I FEEL SORRY FOR YOU.

199
00:14:04,967 --> 00:14:06,727
( Administrator chuckles )

200
00:14:06,727 --> 00:14:08,437
Eugeo: MAYBE THAT’S
HOW YOU FEEL,

201
00:14:08,437 --> 00:14:11,687
STARVED FOR LOVE,
LOOKING ALL OVER,

202
00:14:11,687 --> 00:14:13,897
AND NEVER FINDING IT.

203
00:14:13,897 --> 00:14:16,567
BUT LOVE ISN’T ABOUT CONTROL,

204
00:14:16,567 --> 00:14:20,067
AND YOU DON’T GIVE IT TO GET
SOMETHING, LIKE A TRANSACTION.

205
00:14:20,067 --> 00:14:23,987
YOU GIVE IT SELFLESSLY,
LIKE YOU GIVE WATER TO A FLOWER.

206
00:14:23,987 --> 00:14:26,327
THAT’S LOVE,
REAL, HONEST LOVE.

207
00:14:28,367 --> 00:14:29,787
Administrator: WHAT A SHAME.

208
00:14:29,787 --> 00:14:32,957
I WANTED TO FORGIVE YOU
FOR YOUR TREASONOUS ACTS

209
00:14:32,957 --> 00:14:36,587
AGAINST THE CHURCH.
I WANTED TO SAVE YOUR SOUL,

210
00:14:36,587 --> 00:14:39,547
AND THIS IS
HOW YOU SPEAK TO ME.

211
00:14:39,547 --> 00:14:41,887
♪

212
00:14:41,887 --> 00:14:43,387
( Eugeo gasping )

213
00:14:43,387 --> 00:14:45,557
Administrator:
I COULD DRAIN YOUR LIFE

214
00:14:45,557 --> 00:14:47,967
AND TURN YOU INTO A JEWEL
IF I WANTED,

215
00:14:47,967 --> 00:14:49,517
BUT THAT WOULD BE A WASTE.

216
00:14:49,517 --> 00:14:52,807
INSTEAD, I’LL SYNTHESIZE YOU
BY FORCE, LIKE HER.

217
00:14:52,807 --> 00:14:54,307
Eugeo: YOU MEAN...

218
00:14:54,307 --> 00:14:56,897
Administrator: THAT’S RIGHT,
SWEET NUMBER THIRTY,

219
00:14:56,897 --> 00:14:58,937
THE ONE YOU’RE
SO INFATUATED WITH.

220
00:14:58,937 --> 00:15:01,027
SHE ALSO REFUSED
TO CHANT THE SPELL,

221
00:15:01,027 --> 00:15:03,567
AND IT TOOK
THE AUTOMATED SENATORS DAYS

222
00:15:03,567 --> 00:15:05,407
TO DISABLE HER CORE PROTECTION.

223
00:15:05,407 --> 00:15:07,237
Eugeo: YOU MONSTERS!

224
00:15:07,237 --> 00:15:08,657
Administrator:
I DIDN’T ACTUALLY SEE IT.

225
00:15:08,657 --> 00:15:10,747
I WAS ASLEEP.

226
00:15:10,747 --> 00:15:13,707
I’M SURE
IT WAS AGONIZING FOR HER.

227
00:15:13,707 --> 00:15:15,207
( Eugeo growls )

228
00:15:15,207 --> 00:15:17,167
Administrator: OH, WELL.
IN THE END,

229
00:15:17,167 --> 00:15:19,917
YOU, TOO, WILL SUFFER
THE SAME EXPERIENCE.

230
00:15:21,927 --> 00:15:23,887
( Eugeo yelling )

231
00:15:23,887 --> 00:15:25,507
♪

232
00:15:29,677 --> 00:15:33,727
I WILL BREAK THROUGH!

233
00:15:34,807 --> 00:15:38,977
( yelling )

234
00:15:38,977 --> 00:15:40,527
( Administrator gasps )

235
00:15:45,447 --> 00:15:47,367
( groans )

236
00:15:47,367 --> 00:15:49,367
( sword clatters )

237
00:15:55,667 --> 00:15:57,627
Administrator: HUMPH!

238
00:15:57,627 --> 00:15:58,877
( Eugeo grunting )

239
00:16:05,047 --> 00:16:07,137
Administrator: THAT SWORD.

240
00:16:07,137 --> 00:16:09,887
OH, NOW I SEE.

241
00:16:11,097 --> 00:16:12,517
( Chudelkin whimpering )

242
00:16:14,187 --> 00:16:16,057
SAVE ME!

243
00:16:16,057 --> 00:16:17,107
( gasps )

244
00:16:17,107 --> 00:16:19,107
OH, PLEASE, YOUR EMINENCE!

245
00:16:19,107 --> 00:16:21,567
I NEED ASSISTANCE HERE!

246
00:16:21,567 --> 00:16:23,897
( gasps ) YOU TRAITOR!

247
00:16:23,897 --> 00:16:26,527
THIS LITTLE BASTARD
BETRAYED YOU, YOUR EMINENCE!

248
00:16:26,527 --> 00:16:29,277
HE SAID HE TRAPPED NUMBER THIRTY
AND THAT OTHER ROGUE,

249
00:16:29,277 --> 00:16:30,657
BUT HE DIDN’T EVEN--

250
00:16:30,657 --> 00:16:32,827
( screams )

251
00:16:32,827 --> 00:16:34,287
LET GO! LET GO!

252
00:16:34,287 --> 00:16:37,167
( whimpering )

253
00:16:37,167 --> 00:16:38,877
♪

254
00:16:45,467 --> 00:16:46,887
Eugeo: KIRITO.

255
00:16:52,927 --> 00:16:54,887
( chuckles )

256
00:16:54,887 --> 00:16:57,437
Kirito: WHAT’S UP, EUGEO?

257
00:17:00,647 --> 00:17:01,767
( laughs )

258
00:17:01,767 --> 00:17:03,817
( Eugeo chuckles )

259
00:17:03,817 --> 00:17:05,737
( crying )

260
00:17:05,737 --> 00:17:07,197
SORRY.

261
00:17:07,197 --> 00:17:09,907
I GAVE IN
TO ADMINISTRATOR’S TEMPTATION

262
00:17:09,907 --> 00:17:12,447
AND TRIED TO KILL YOU BOTH.

263
00:17:12,447 --> 00:17:15,747
I WANTED TO SACRIFICE MYSELF
TO ATONE FOR IT.

264
00:17:15,747 --> 00:17:17,617
Kirito: I KNEW THAT’S
WHAT YOU WERE GOIN’ FOR.

265
00:17:17,617 --> 00:17:20,497
WE BEEN FRIENDS SO LONG,
I CAN READ YOU LIKE A BOOK.

266
00:17:20,497 --> 00:17:21,497
( Eugeo gasps )

267
00:17:21,497 --> 00:17:22,747
( chuckles )

268
00:17:22,747 --> 00:17:24,457
YOU NEVER CHANGE, DO YOU?

269
00:17:24,457 --> 00:17:25,917
( Kirito chuckles )

270
00:17:25,917 --> 00:17:27,877
( Eugeo gasps )

271
00:17:27,877 --> 00:17:29,507
ALICE...

272
00:17:32,257 --> 00:17:34,677
( sniffles )

273
00:17:40,227 --> 00:17:41,147
( Kirito chuckles )

274
00:17:42,977 --> 00:17:46,897
IS THAT HER, ADMINISTRATOR?

275
00:17:46,897 --> 00:17:51,907
Alice: YES. SHE LOOKS THE SAME
AS SHE DID SIX YEARS AGO.

276
00:17:51,907 --> 00:17:53,657
Administrator:
BERCOULI AND FANATIO

277
00:17:53,657 --> 00:17:56,367
WERE JUST ABOUT DUE
FOR ME TO RESET THEM,

278
00:17:56,367 --> 00:17:58,287
BUT YOU, ALICE,
I’VE ONLY HAD YOU

279
00:17:58,287 --> 00:18:00,747
FOR, WHAT, SIX YEARS NOW?

280
00:18:00,747 --> 00:18:03,957
YOUR LOGIC CIRCUITS
DON’T SEEM TO BE MALFUNCTIONING.

281
00:18:03,957 --> 00:18:08,507
PERHAPS THAT IRREGULAR UNIT
IS INFLUENCING YOU. HMM.

282
00:18:08,507 --> 00:18:09,677
( Alice grunts )

283
00:18:09,677 --> 00:18:11,177
Administrator:
WHAT IS IT, ALICE?

284
00:18:11,177 --> 00:18:14,307
IF YOU WISH TO SAY SOMETHING
TO ME, THEN JUST SAY IT.

285
00:18:14,307 --> 00:18:18,017
I WON’T GET MAD.
PLEASE, SPEAK YOUR MIND.

286
00:18:18,017 --> 00:18:19,017
( Alice gasps )

287
00:18:22,107 --> 00:18:23,937
( sighs )

288
00:18:25,067 --> 00:18:27,397
♪

289
00:18:30,737 --> 00:18:32,237
I WILL, YOUR EMINENCE.

290
00:18:32,237 --> 00:18:35,027
AS OF TODAY, THE PROUD ORDER

291
00:18:35,027 --> 00:18:37,077
OF THE INTEGRITY KNIGHTS
HAS FALLEN.

292
00:18:37,077 --> 00:18:38,197
( Administrator sighs )

293
00:18:38,197 --> 00:18:40,327
Alice: ALL IT TOOK
TO BRING IT DOWN

294
00:18:40,327 --> 00:18:42,667
WERE THE SWORDS
OF THE TWO REBELS AT MY SIDE

295
00:18:42,667 --> 00:18:45,627
AND THE OBSESSION
AND DECEIT OF YOUR RULE,

296
00:18:45,627 --> 00:18:48,337
REPRESENTED BY THIS CATHEDRAL!

297
00:18:48,337 --> 00:18:51,297
MY DUTY IS
NOT TO PROTECT THE CHURCH,

298
00:18:51,297 --> 00:18:55,097
BUT TO PROTECT THE INNOCENT
AND SAFEGUARD THEIR PEACE.

299
00:18:55,097 --> 00:18:57,887
IT IS YOUR ACTIONS,
MORE THAN ANYTHING ELSE,

300
00:18:57,887 --> 00:18:59,637
WHICH THREATEN THE WELL-BEING

301
00:18:59,637 --> 00:19:01,937
OF THE CITIZENS
OF THE HUMAN EMPIRE.

302
00:19:01,937 --> 00:19:03,807
( Administrator chuckles )

303
00:19:03,807 --> 00:19:06,767
Chudelkin: YOU, SHUT YOUR MOUTH!

304
00:19:06,767 --> 00:19:07,857
HOW DARE--

305
00:19:07,857 --> 00:19:10,187
DUTY, YOU SAY,
YOU BROKEN TOY?!

306
00:19:10,187 --> 00:19:12,817
HAH! YOU KNIGHTS ARE
NOTHING MORE THAN DOLLS.

307
00:19:12,817 --> 00:19:14,907
YOUR "DUTY," AS YOU PUT IT,
IS TO DO WHAT I...

308
00:19:14,907 --> 00:19:16,277
Administrator: FASCINATING.

309
00:19:16,277 --> 00:19:19,747
IT ISN’T A LOGIC CIRCUIT ERROR
AFTER ALL,

310
00:19:19,747 --> 00:19:23,457
AND HER PIETY MODULE
IS STILL FUNCTIONING,

311
00:19:23,457 --> 00:19:25,587
WHICH MEANS
SHE MUST HAVE DISABLED

312
00:19:25,587 --> 00:19:28,417
THE CODE 871
THAT WAS INSTALLED FOR ME

313
00:19:28,417 --> 00:19:32,717
BY HER OWN VOLITION,
RATHER THAN BY SUDDEN EMOTION.

314
00:19:32,717 --> 00:19:36,427
Kirito: THAT THING IN HER EYE’S
CALLED CODE 871?

315
00:19:36,427 --> 00:19:38,347
Administrator: I WON’T
KNOW HOW IT HAPPENED

316
00:19:38,347 --> 00:19:40,137
UNTIL I RUN AN ANALYSIS.

317
00:19:41,637 --> 00:19:43,977
- NOW, THEN, CHUDELKIN...
- ( Chudelkin gasps )

318
00:19:43,977 --> 00:19:45,397
Administrator:
SINCE I AM GENEROUS,

319
00:19:45,397 --> 00:19:47,107
I SHALL GIVE YOU THE CHANCE

320
00:19:47,107 --> 00:19:49,107
TO RESTORE
YOUR TATTERED REPUTATION.

321
00:19:49,107 --> 00:19:52,447
USE YOUR SACRED ARTS,
AND DEAL WITH THOSE THREE.

322
00:19:56,027 --> 00:19:57,367
Chudelkin:
B-B-BUT, YOUR EMINENCE!

323
00:19:57,367 --> 00:19:59,197
YOUR GLORIOUSNESS!

324
00:19:59,197 --> 00:20:00,827
Administrator: YES? WHAT IS IT?

325
00:20:00,827 --> 00:20:02,747
- ( Chudelkin whimpers )
- ( all gasp )

326
00:20:02,747 --> 00:20:04,747
Chudelkin:
FOR THE FIRST AND ONLY TIME

327
00:20:04,747 --> 00:20:07,377
IN MY MANY YEARS
OF SERVICE TO YOU,

328
00:20:07,377 --> 00:20:10,627
I WOULD LIKE TO PRESENT YOU
WITH A MOST IMPUDENT REQUEST.

329
00:20:10,627 --> 00:20:12,547
I SHALL HAPPILY RISK MY LIFE

330
00:20:12,547 --> 00:20:14,837
ANNIHILATING THESE TRAITORS.
HOWEVER...

331
00:20:14,837 --> 00:20:18,007
ONCE I HAVE FULFILLED
YOUR WISHES, WOULD YOU--

332
00:20:18,007 --> 00:20:21,347
( stammers ) W-WOULD YOU
LET ME TOUCH YOUR EXALTED BODY

333
00:20:21,347 --> 00:20:22,887
AND K-K-KISS YOUR LIPS

334
00:20:22,887 --> 00:20:25,937
AND SP-SP-SPEND ONE
MAGICAL NIGHT ALONE WITH YOU?!

335
00:20:25,937 --> 00:20:27,017
UH, PLEASE!

336
00:20:27,017 --> 00:20:28,307
PLEASE!

337
00:20:28,307 --> 00:20:29,647
I WOULD BE MOST GRATEFUL

338
00:20:29,647 --> 00:20:32,107
IF YOU GRANTED ME
SUCH A DELIGHT!

339
00:20:34,027 --> 00:20:36,157
( Administrator laughs )

340
00:20:36,157 --> 00:20:37,777
VERY WELL, CHUDELKIN.

341
00:20:37,777 --> 00:20:39,117
( Chudelkin gasps )

342
00:20:39,117 --> 00:20:40,867
Administrator: I SWEAR
TO THE GODDESS STACIA,

343
00:20:40,867 --> 00:20:43,697
AS SOON AS YOU
HAVE FULFILLED YOUR MISSION,

344
00:20:43,697 --> 00:20:46,367
MY BODY WILL BE YOURS
FOR THE TAKING,

345
00:20:46,367 --> 00:20:49,167
EVERY INCH, FOR ONE NIGHT.

346
00:20:49,167 --> 00:20:51,797
( Chudelkin gasps )

347
00:20:51,797 --> 00:20:54,377
WORDS CANNOT EXPRESS
THE JOY YOU’VE BROUGHT ME,

348
00:20:54,377 --> 00:20:56,797
YOUR EXALTED HOLINESS!

349
00:20:56,797 --> 00:21:00,757
AND I SWEAR TO YOU,
I WILL NOT LET YOU DOWN.

350
00:21:00,757 --> 00:21:01,757
HUP!

351
00:21:01,757 --> 00:21:04,347
I AM RESOLUTE AND ENERGIZED!

352
00:21:04,347 --> 00:21:09,977
I AM MOTIVATED,
AND I AM INVINCIBLE!

353
00:21:09,977 --> 00:21:13,987
SYSTEM CALL!

354
00:21:13,987 --> 00:21:20,737
GENERATE THERMAL ELEMENT!

355
00:21:22,577 --> 00:21:26,867
( groans )

356
00:21:26,867 --> 00:21:29,167
- ( Kirito gasps )
- ( Chudelkin chuckles )

357
00:21:29,167 --> 00:21:34,507
NOW I WILL SHOW YOU
MY GREATEST SACRED ART!

358
00:21:34,507 --> 00:21:35,667
COME FORTH, GENIE,

359
00:21:35,667 --> 00:21:41,257
AND BURN THESE TRAITORS TO ASH!

360
00:21:41,257 --> 00:21:42,347
( all gasp )

361
00:21:42,347 --> 00:21:44,557
♪

362
00:22:06,037 --> 00:22:09,537
Singer: ♪ OH, EVERYTHING
TURNS TO ASH, TO ASH ♪

363
00:22:09,537 --> 00:22:11,457
( singing in Japanese )

364
00:22:19,087 --> 00:22:22,547
♪ AND EVERYTHING
TURNS TO DUST, TO DUST ♪

365
00:22:22,547 --> 00:22:24,467
( singing in Japanese )

366
00:22:32,227 --> 00:22:34,187
♪ FORGET-ME-NOT ♪

